## Scripts

This folder contains relevant scripts.

1.  fine-tuning: Fine-tuning script for foundation models. Tested on MegaDescriptor, MiewID, DINOv3
2.  sweep.py: script to program and run parameter search. 
    hooks up to "fine-tuning.py"
    requires a unique version of the fine-tuning script for each model the user wants to store in the script simultaneously
